<h2>Permits in New Braunfels</h2>
<p>The City of New Braunfels has its own building permit and inspection office, separate from the City of San Antonio. Properties outside city limits follow county requirements. Confirm permits before replacing a roof or making structural repairs. Code-required upgrades are paid only if your policy includes ordinance or law coverage, up to its limit; see our <a href="/local-building-codes/">building codes and insurance repairs guide</a>.</p>

